<title>USA: Diametrics Medical names financial officer.</title>
<headline>Diametrics Medical names financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said Tuesday Larry Betterley was named to the position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Betterley joined Diametrics from Cray Research Inc, where he was chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Diametrics said Betterley will report to David Giddings, chief executive officer.</p>
<p>A Diametrics spokesman said Betterley succeeds Dennis McFadden, who left the company in late June 1996.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
